{"3947470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beat Paws Odyssey", "steam_appid": 3947470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When you’re busy, they keep moving with you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌙 This is not a game that demands your attention</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat Paws Odyssey runs quietly while you use your computer.<br>Every keystroke and mouse click gives them energy to continue their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=620 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat.<br>No reflex tests.<br>No need to stay focused on the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do your thing.<br>They do theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐾 Your everyday actions become their adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They travel across the world—running, stopping, looking around.<br>Along the way, they collect all kinds of charming accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress them up however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes,<br>when you’re not paying attention,<br>they might even whisper to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤍 Some companionship is quiet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stay connected with friends.<br>Even when you’re each busy with your own lives,<br>your little companions move together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No interruptions.<br>No pressure to interact.<br>Just the feeling that<br><strong>someone else is there too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/764523f6f121da0c2760f04043c34ec1.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=660 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/764523f6f121da0c2760f04043c34ec1.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/764523f6f121da0c2760f04043c34ec1.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Perfect for moments like these</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late-night work sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coding, designing, studying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listening to music while working</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you just don’t want your desktop to feel empty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎁 Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=620 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn keyboard and mouse activity into energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no stress, runs alongside your daily tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple animals and cosmetic collections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online companion mode with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and unobtrusive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat Paws Odyssey isn’t a game that takes your time— it stays with you while time passes.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When you’re busy, they keep moving with you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌙 This is not a game that demands your attention</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat Paws Odyssey runs quietly while you use your computer.<br>Every keystroke and mouse click gives them energy to continue their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=620 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared